//   MOUNT    a saved IA: its request read (STATUS) only when the IA links one - every other IA opens with no extra call; a Draft
//            with none shows only Request Materials (the action bar, ia_create_transfer_request): every other user sees no change
//   NEW      Request Materials: the section with the staging storage location, bin and the date the materials are required, and Create
//   CREATE / REFRESH / CANCEL   IA_TRANSFER_REQUEST; the IA as this screen shows it goes along (IA1), so unsaved edits are refused
//            there; the answer said, the section shown again from the request's status
